      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبَيْطَرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُبَاطِرٌ</span></b>  <i>Tall,</i> or <i>long.</i> (M, K.) ― 
