long neck,</i> (S, K,) <i>which one sees always in
shallow water; surnamed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبُو العَيْزَارِ</span>. (S.) [Freytag says, on the authority of Dmr, that it is also
